    "optimizedContext": {
      "value": "# ValidateArtifacts\n## Rules\n- Resolve change/schema; validate artifacts topologically. Required non-missing; optional `skipped` valid.\n- Apply/validate deltas, rules, cross-artifact checks; hash cleaned raw content then `markComplete`.\n- Reconcile fresh artifact/implementation validity atomically; persist progress/audit via `ChangeRepository.mutate`.\n## Constraints\n- Only `ValidateArtifacts` calls `Artifact.markComplete(hash)`.\n- Never write merged specs to `SpecRepository`.",
